                  {
                    "cmd": "text",
                    "text": "A planted Berry will soon sprout, grow into a plant, flower beaultifully, the grow Berries again."
                  },
                  {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
                  {
                    "cmd": "text",
                    "text": "I want to see the whole wide world filled with beaultiful flowers.\\nThat's my dream."
                  },
                  {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
                  {
                    "cmd": "text",
                    "text": "Please help me, \\PN. Plant Berries and bring more flowers into the world."
